BT 1 0 0 1 0 37.5 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8.5 Tf .2 .254902 .333333 rg (This Software Requirements Specification \(SRS\) establishes the authoritative technical foundation for the ) Tj /F2 8.5 Tf (MEV Shield &) Tj T* (Real-Time Blockchain Mempool Attack Detection System) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf ( \(Version 1.0.0\). It defines functional algorithms, external interfaces,) Tj T* (performance thresholds, and security parameters necessary to monitor unconfirmed EVM transactions, quantify risk, and protect) Tj T* (decentralized exchange traders against malicious MEV extraction.) Tj T* ET
