BT 1 0 0 1 0 49 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8.5 Tf .2 .254902 .333333 rg (The system functions as a high-throughput, low-latency analytical middleware and responsive single-page web application. Its) Tj T* (boundary encompasses: \(1\) Ingestion of unconfirmed Ethereum transactions via Alchemy WebSocket and polling fallbacks; \(2\)) Tj T* (Real-time parsing of DEX swap call data; \(3\) Algorithmic classification of sandwich attacks, front-running, and back-running; \(4\)) Tj T* (Dynamic slippage and risk score calculation; \(5\) Private transaction routing through the Flashbots Protect network; \(6\) Market) Tj T* (momentum analytics \(RSI, MACD, Fear & Greed Index\); \(7\) Educational attack simulation; and \(8\) Multi-channel alerts.) Tj T* ET
Q
